		{
			"id": "eo1BdwLuwEPDPOND4",
			"description": "Plasma Pistol",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Widely carried by Inquisitors, veteran officers and Astartes as a compact answer to armour a bolt pistol cannot beat; Black Library and Codex background repeatedly show plasma pistols overheating and injuring or killing careless users, a trait long associated with older, unstable patterns especially.\n\nDesign: Scaled down two dice from the plasma gun anchor (6dx4(3) burn ex) to 4dx4(3) burn ex for the standard, safe firing mode, keeping the same x4 standard / x5 supercharged multiplier pair used across every weapon in this file; the ×5 supercharged mode trades a Malf 14 risk for another 25% of damage. Checked with the exact dice distribution: standard mode averages 56 damage and penetrates Astartes power armour (DR 100, effective DR 33) 95% of the time and a Terminator (DR 200, effective DR 66) 24% of the time; supercharged raises Terminator penetration to 99%. A pistol-class charge clears flak and carapace with no meaningful chance of failure either way.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Adeptus Astartes",
				"Inquisition"
			],
			"tech_level": "11",
			"legality_class": "1",
			"base_value": "2200",
			"base_weight": "5 lb",
