		{
			"id": "eKHgSjbulJ6LgaJVK",
			"description": "Plasma Cannon",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A tripod- or vehicle-mounted heavy weapon fielded by Astra Militarum heavy weapon teams and Devastator squads, background consistently treats it as a slow-firing but devastating answer to Astartes-scale infantry and light vehicles at range, at the price of a low rate of fire while the reactor cycles.\n\nDesign: Two dice over the plasma gun anchor (8dx4(3) vs 6dx4(3), supercharged 8dx5(3)), matching the standard progression used for the bolt and melta families in this project. Checked against the vehicle table: standard mode averages 112 and, even against AV12 (DR 200, effective DR 66), penetrates 99% of hits, comfortably beating the light and medium vehicles the fiction shows it killing. Low RoF 1 and ST 15 (tripod or a very strong user) capture the \"slow-firing but devastating\" character the fiction gives it; Malf 15 rather than 14 for the standard/overcharge pair reflects a crew-served weapon's better cooling and shielding, at correspondingly higher stakes for the crew when it does fail.",
