		{
			"id": "eL61SOulLgKLL-z1J",
			"description": "Plasma Incinerator, Primaris Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Standard-issue Primaris plasma weapon (Hellblaster squads and others), Codex background describes it as an improved, more reliable containment design over the legacy plasma gun rather than a fundamentally different weapon.\n\nDesign: One pip over the plasma gun anchor (6d+1x4(3) vs 6dx4(3), supercharged 6d+1x5(3)) for the \"improved\" cartridge, on a lighter, easier-handling ST 11 frame with better range (200/600) for the improved optics. Against a Terminator (DR 200, effective DR 66) the extra pip nudges standard-mode penetration from the plasma gun's 86% to 90%; the higher Malf 15 on its supercharged mode reflects the claimed better containment without pretending overheating risk is eliminated.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Adeptus Astartes"
			],
