		{
			"id": "e_2yDeeS4KJbbR8dB",
			"description": "Heavy Plasma Incinerator, Primaris Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The two-handed, un-mounted heavy weapon carried by Primaris Hellblaster squads' heavy-weapon troopers, background treats it as a genuine step up in output over the standard plasma incinerator, manageable only because of a Primaris Marine's greater strength, not because the weapon itself is lighter.\n\nDesign: Matches the Plasma Cannon's damage (8dx4(3)/8dx5(3)) since both fire a cannon-class charge, but keeps RoF 3 rather than the cannon's RoF 1 and drops the tripod requirement, reflecting that this is a man-portable weapon for a superhuman user rather than a crew-served support gun; ST 13 is set below the Plasma Cannon's ST 15 for the same reason.",
